    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body": "```js\r\nconst wrappedWidget = Object.create(widget);\r\nwrappedWidget.render = args => {\r\n  widget.render(args);\r\n  // ... other stuff\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis way we rely on the prototype chain for dispatching the calls to the methods.",
